==Notes==
*Despite also being part of Empire of Cats, the Aku Realms are ''much'' harder than [[Zombie Outbreaks]], which is due in no small part to their far wider roster of enemies. Most of the enemies encountered are unrelated to those found in the normal Empire of Cats stages. Expect to see every trait except [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]; [[:Category:Stories of Legend Enemies|Stories of Legend Enemies]] like [[Brollow]], [[Two Can]] and [[Henry]]; [[Into the Future]] [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] like [[Zuche]] and [[Cadaver Bear]]; and even a few [[:Category:Uncanny Legends Enemies|Uncanny Legends Enemies]] like [[Gobble]], [[Zollow]] and [[Ragin' Gory]].
*The Aku Altar only restricts normal levels and + levels; other upgrades such as [[True Form]]s, [[Talents]] and [[Talent Orbs]] will not be affected.
*Since the Aku Altar restricts + levels until Mount Aku's invasion is cleared, [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will have extremely low stats, for example [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] will only have 7,200 HP at Seal 20 and beyond. [[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cats]] will be much more effective since they only rely on normal levels, and have stats designed around lower levels.
*Despite technically being an extension to [[Empire of Cats]], the Aku Realms are officially considered as their own [[Main Chapters Levels|story chapter]].

