==Trivia==
*The text on the background of uncleared Aku Realm stage buttons is upside-down katakana which translates to: "Stealing energy from another world; the [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Devils' Fortress]] seals levels."
*The book next to the "Aku Altar Appears!" button looks the same as [[Possessed Empress]]' cursed grimoire.
*The "crystal of awakening" mentioned in the intro may be the blue eyeball in [[High Priest Mamon]]'s hand.
*According to the intro, the full title of the chapter is "The Aku Realms: Dark Priest's Desire".
*Although it is called "The Aku Realms", the button says "The Aku Gates", possibly meaning that the button itself is the entrance.
*The length of [[Dark Priest Mamon|Mamon]]'s 9-year scheme is the same as between the release of [[Nyanko Daisensou]] (2012) and [[Version 10.9 Update|update 10.9]] (2021), as well as how long it took for [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Cat]] to finish reading every book in the royal library.
*The Aku Realms were mentioned in [[Aku Cyclone]]'s descriptions, [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]]'s Japanese description and Evil Aku Researcher's sign before being added to the game.
*The Aku Realms' [[Media:Demonmap img01.png|Japanese logo]] resembles the [[wikia:capcomdatabase:Media:MakaimuraWSLogo.png|Japanese ''Ghosts 'n Goblins'' logo]].
*The Aku Realms is the only chapter without a [[Cat Base Menu]].

